      "Language": "por",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Cancer pain relief is not yet adequate, but there are resources for this. Professional's misconception and the tabu about that pain in cancer is inevitable have been contributing to this problem. Important nurses' knowledge lacuna about pain relief in cancer was found by this study. The WHO program about pain relief in cancer is presented too."},
